config RMW_ZENOH_PICO
    bool "Enable rmw_zenoh_pico integration"
    default y
    help
      Enable the rmw_zenoh_pico Zephyr module. This provides a thin wrapper
      API for simple publish/subscribe usage on Zephyr without pulling in
      full ROS 2 dependencies.

